ngs really  makes you know playing  flame travel very very safe airlines say  there have only been about 44  documented cases of a passenger getting  coveted during a flight  and all but two of those happened before  mass mandates were in place  now critics say it's hard to get a firm  number because so many people can be  asymptomatic  and contact tracing in the u.s is  lacking  for cbs this morning saturday chris van  cleave  washington
 

